        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I first took these products “la Cure” in 2005 and I describe them nothing short of a miracle.   After a trip to Cuba and two years of daily diarrhoea, Everything was cleared up, including other ailments that I have just been living with thinking they were for life.  My severe allergies completely disappeared and never came back.  My lactose intolerance is history 20 years later never been an issue ever again.  I repeated the detox several times with astounding results of success.   Herbal remedies are definitely number one over pharmaceuticals because instead of masking the symptoms it completely eliminated all of mine. Five star 10 out of 10 and I could not recommend this product enough",
        "time": 1760643239,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "isabelle brophy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105090155793344972402/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUgJQ_yKpb48iZnxZxaO6uE4yZQlOLhSweKtV-7NrEXvItkWzz4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I love the products you offer and especially the quality of your supplements! Your products are pure, and you add silica, this little-known trace element that has many benefits for the body, to the supplement in question. Your products are not coated with derivatives, excessive food additives, or added sugar, palm oil, and other ingredients. Bravo! for your product offerings and the rigor of your customer service and your online services, which are also fast! Let's support this great company; when we compare the ingredients of other companies' supplements, we understand that the best in Quebec are Herbages Normex!\np.s. No, I'm not paid to write this review! :) A loyal user!",
        "time": 1749875190,
        "translated": true
      },
