      {
        "author_name": "Sacha Bouchard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117018717812276462935/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ3vAixdJiH1C4RJ1LHWirh0e86ve34oe1bThjAb3oo6WhB3Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I am very satisfied with Normex products. I have been using them for about sixty years. Without them, I wouldn't be here writing to you. Traditional medicine should be more open to natural products that offer only benefits without side effects when the dosage is properly controlled, like Normex products. In my case, where traditional medicine couldn't do anything for me, Normex products brought me a cure that allowed me to live a normal life. With the excellent advice of Mr. Normandin and then the new owners, I continue to take good care of my health. In my case, it was a matter of survival. Thank you, and please continue to help people take control of their health.",
        "time": 1749845149,
        "translated": true
      },
